ent of digital transformation to make fiscal operations more effective. While digital transformation is often focused first within agencies, a broader perspective reveals tremendous opportunities. Where do opportunities exist? How should they be approached, and what lessons can be learned","display_url":"imfconnect.org/content/imf/en…","end":220,"expanded_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/13/212658.html","start":197,"status":200,"title":"New Economy Forum Workshop: From Tax to Treasury: Building Digitally Connected Public Finance","unwound_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/13/212658.html","url":"https://t.co/Bcj8Qh0xTq"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/FRKfW3VGGv","end":244,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109849121519776233/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109849113013682176","start":221,"url":"https://t.co/FRKfW3VGGv"}]},"id":"2109849121519776233","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":13027,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"WATCH LIVE: How can digital interoperability across revenue and spending agencies make fiscal operations more effective? Practitioners share lessons from reforms that delivered measurable results: https://t.co/Bcj8Qh0xTq https://t.co/FRKfW3VGGv","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109849121519776233"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:15:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109845340631507101"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Global Financial Stability Report | October 2026","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":135,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1qKDzWdXaXVJV","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109845319139860480/A905E3uf?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109845319139860480/A905E3uf?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":112,"status":200,"title":"IMF","un