 latest World Economic Outlook projects growth at 3.1% in 2026 and 3.4% in 2027, with inflation rising this year before easing next year. Learn how geopolitics and AI are reshaping the outlook. https://t.co/vwXHRxkW4n https://t.co/hG1eUVER2u","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109832746558451923"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109827717122478080"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:05:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109827720020742492"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JkzG2u8FQM","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109827720020742492/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109827717122478080","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/JkzG2u8FQM"}]},"id":"2109827720020742492","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":23194,"like_count":234,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":81},"text":"The global economy remains resilient, but that resilience is becoming more fragile and more uneven. Growth is projected at 3.1% in 2026 and 3.4% in 2027, while inflation is expected to reach 4.7%, driven largely by higher energy and food prices. Read the IMF's latest analysis: https://t.co/JkzG2u8FQM","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109827720020742492"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109826710393036800"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:01:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109826714289463459"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/NROY5TCdjY","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109826714289463459/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109826710393036800","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/NROY5TCdjY"}]},"id":"2109826714289463459","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1351,"impression_count":1156045,"like_count":10829,"quote_count":894,"reply_count":633,"retweet_count":3609},"text":"IMF Growth Forecast 2026:  \n🇺🇸 US: 2.3% \n🇩🇪 Germany: 1.3% \n🇫🇷 France: 0.4% \n🇮🇹 Italy: 0.8% \n🇪🇸 Spain: 2.5% \n🇬🇧 UK: 1.3% \n🇯🇵 Japan:0.7% \n🇨🇦 Canada: 1.1% \n🇨🇳 China:4.5% \n🇮🇳 India: 7.0% \n🇷🇺 Russia:0.9% \n🇧🇷 Brazil: 2.2% \n🇲🇽 Mexico: 1.5% \n🇸🇦 Saudi Arabia: -3.3% \n🇳🇬 Nigeria: 4.2% \n🇿🇦 https://t.co/NROY5TCdjY","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109826714289463459"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109826460714504415"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"World Economic Outlook Press Briefing | October 2026","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":252,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jGXgBdvzLjKZ","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109826444188868608/Sd5BpNkX?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109826444188868608/Sd5BpNkX?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":229,"status":200,"title":"IMF","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jGXgBdvzLjKZ","url":"https://t.co/Yu9Q6ILUo5"}]},"id":"2109826460714504415","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":13759,"like_count":41,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":20},"text":"🔴 LIVE: Watch the release of the October 2026 World Economic Outlook, with the latest global growth projections, risks, and policy recommendations.  Join IMF Chief Economist Silvana Tenreyro for the press briefing.  \n\nWatch now: https://t.co/Yu9Q6ILUo5","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109826460714504415"},{"author_id":"68746721","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:25:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109802734899880280"],"id":"2109802734899880280","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":340,"impression_count":82459,"like_count":2898,"quote_count":41,"reply_count":165,"retweet_count":205},"text":"If you explained agriculture to folks in SF, you'd blow so many minds. It's... self-replicating, recursively self-improving nanotech for the physical world. And it's all open-source!\n\nOne instance can turn into hundreds of seeds, that turn into hundreds of instances. Next thing","url":"https://x.com/fchollet/status/2109802734899880280"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_21